{"topicCode":"M22102","details":"<h1 class=\"study-h1\">中級單元十：智慧設備管理維護與製程大數據（L22103–L22105）</h1>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">對應官方評鑑主題 <strong class=\"study-strong\">L221</strong>，本單元涵蓋 L22103（自動設備管理與維護）、L22104（智慧製造設備管理與維護）、L22105（生產工程大數據即時收集分析），是設備管理策略與數據應用的核心。</p>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">1. 自動設備管理與維護基本概念（L22103）</h2>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(1) 四大維護策略選擇矩陣</h3>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>策略</th><th>觸發條件</th><th>適用情境</th><th>優點</th><th>缺點</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">BM 事後維護</strong></td><td>故障後修</td><td>低重要性、備品充足、後果小</td><td>前期監測投入較低</td><td>非計畫停機及連帶損失可能很高</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">PM 預防性維護</strong></td><td>固定時間/循環數</td><td>故障模式規律、有明確維護區間</td><td>可計畫排程</td><td>可能過度保養浪費</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">CBM 狀態維護</strong></td><td>監測狀態達處置條件</td><td>可取得有效狀態資料的設備</td><td>可依實際狀態介入，準確性須驗證</td><td>需有效量測、基線與處置規則</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">PdM 預測性維護</strong></td><td>統計、物理模型或 AI/ML 預測衰退／維護時點</td><td>高價值關鍵設備；有可用數據或可靠失效模型</td><td>可提前介入，效果須持續驗證</td><td>模型及數據建置維護成本</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">RCM（以可靠性為中心的維護）</strong>：針對每個設備失效模式，系統化選擇最適合的維護策略組合，最大化維護效益。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(2) MTBF 與 MTTR 計算</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"></p><div class=\"math-block\" data-raw-math=\"$$MTBF = \\frac{\\text{總運作時間}}{\\text{故障次數}}, \\quad MTTR = \\frac{\\text{總修復時間}}{\\text{故障次數}}$$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>總運作時間</mtext><mtext>故障次數</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>總修復時間</mtext><mtext>故障次數</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MTBF = \\frac{\\text{總運作時間}}{\\text{故障次數}}, \\quad MTTR = \\frac{\\text{總修復時間}}{\\text{故障次數}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">MTBF</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">故障次數</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">總運作時間</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">MTTR</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">故障次數</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">總修復時間</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p></p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"></p><div class=\"math-block\" data-raw-math=\"$$\\text{設備可用度（Availability）} = \\frac{MTBF}{MTBF + MTTR} \\times 100\\%$$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>設備可用度（Availability）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{設備可用度（Availability）} = \\frac{MTBF}{MTBF + MTTR} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">設備可用度（</span><span class=\"mord\">Availability</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">MTBF</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">MTTR</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">MTBF</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p></p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">例題</strong>：觀察期間共 720 小時，除 12 小時故障修復外均持續運轉，發生 4 次故障：</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"></p><div class=\"math-block\" data-raw-math=\"$$MTBF = \\frac{720-12}{4} = 177\\ \\text{h}, \\quad MTTR = \\frac{12}{4} = 3\\ \\text{h}$$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>720</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>177</mn><mtext>&nbsp;h</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>&nbsp;h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MTBF = \\frac{720-12}{4} = 177\\ \\text{h}, \\quad MTTR = \\frac{12}{4} = 3\\ \\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">MTBF</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">720</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">177</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">MTTR</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p></p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"></p><div class=\"math-block\" data-raw-math=\"$$\\text{可用度} = \\frac{177}{177+3} = 98.3\\%$$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可用度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>177</mn><mrow><mn>177</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>98.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可用度} = \\frac{177}{177+3} = 98.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可用度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">177</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">177</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">98.3%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p></p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">MTBF 提升策略</strong>：改善設備品質（TPM 自主保養）；消除根本失效原因。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">MTTR 縮短策略</strong>：備品預置（Spare Parts 安全庫存）；維修程序標準化。</p>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">2. 智慧製造之設備管理與維護基本概念（L22104）</h2>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(1) CMMS（電腦化維護管理系統）與 MES 整合</h3>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>功能模組</th><th>說明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>維護工單管理</td><td>MES 設備警報自動觸發開立；或依保養計畫定期開立</td></tr><tr><td>備品庫存管理</td><td>關鍵零件安全庫存管理，避免停工等待備品</td></tr><tr><td>保養紀錄</td><td>每次保養項目、換件、技術員 ID 完整歸檔</td></tr><tr><td>維護成本追蹤</td><td>各設備年度維護成本分析，支援換機決策</td></tr><tr><td>KPI 儀表板</td><td>MTBF、MTTR、PM 完成率、緊急維修占比</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"mermaid-block\"><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-src=\"assets/diagrams/d0af770d2508c0c2.svg\">flowchart LR\n  MES[\"MES<br>（設備異常警報）\"] --&gt;|自動觸發| CMMS[\"CMMS<br>（開立維修工單）\"]\n  CMMS --&gt;|分派| TECH[\"維修技術員\"]\n  TECH --&gt;|完工記錄| CMMS\n  CMMS --&gt;|歷史數據| ANALYSIS[\"維護成本分析<br>MTBF/MTTR 趨勢\"]\n  ANALYSIS --&gt;|KPI 報告| MGT[\"管理層決策<br>（換機 vs 繼續維修）\"]\n</pre></div>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(2) 設備健康指數（EHI）</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">將多個監測參數整合為 0–100 的單一健康分數：</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"></p><div class=\"math-block\" data-raw-math=\"$$EHI = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot \\text{Score}_i$$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Score</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EHI = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot \\text{Score}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p></p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">各參數評分依「偏離正常基線的程度」降低；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$w_i$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 為重要性權重，採加權平均時須使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$\\sum w_i=1$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum w_i=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，並先讓各分數使用一致尺度。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">示意應用</strong>：可設黃色警戒與紅色處置區，但門檻須以設備失效風險與歷史驗證決定；70／50 等分數不是所有設備通用標準。</p>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">3. 生產工程大數據即時收集、分析、管理與應用（L22105）</h2>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(1) 製程參數大數據四大應用場景</h3>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>場景</th><th>輸入數據</th><th>分析方法</th><th>輸出</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>良率預測</td><td>各工序製程參數、設備狀態</td><td>邏輯回歸、隨機森林</td><td>預測本批不良率</td></tr><tr><td>製程視窗優化</td><td>歷史配方 × 品質結果</td><td>回應曲面法（RSM）、DOE</td><td>最佳製程參數窗口</td></tr><tr><td>設備故障預測</td><td>振動/電流/溫度時序數據</td><td>LSTM、SVM、隨機森林</td><td>預測下次故障時間（RUL）</td></tr><tr><td>能耗分析</td><td>設備功率/電流即時數據</td><td>迴歸分析、異常偵測</td><td>識別能耗異常設備</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">(2) 數據品質管理四大問題</h3>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>問題</th><th>原因</th><th>解決方法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">缺值（Missing Value）</strong></td><td>感測器離線、網路中斷</td><td>保留缺值標記；僅在變化特性允許時插值，勿跨故障補成正常</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">異常值（Outlier）</strong></td><td>可能為雜訊，也可能是真實故障</td><td>標記並核對原始事件與設備狀態，確認錯誤後才更正或排除</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">時間偏移（Time Skew）</strong></td><td>設備時鐘未同步</td><td>依同步精度需求對時，保留原始及校正時間與補正依據</td></tr><tr><td><strong class=\"study-strong\">單位不一致</strong></td><td>不同供應商格式不同</td><td>建立數據字典（Data Dictionary）統一 SI 單位</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">&gt; <strong class=\"study-strong\">考試重點</strong>：時序數據分析的第一步不是建模，而是<strong class=\"study-strong\">數據品質審查</strong>；垃圾數據進、垃圾模型出（GIGO: Garbage In, Garbage Out）。</p>\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">核心內容：維護觸發條件與資料證據</h2>\n\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">原創小題</strong>：軸承溫度突然升高，資料清理程式以「超過三倍標準差」自動刪掉。這可能正是故障前兆，應先核對負載、校正與警報紀錄，保留原始值及判定標記。資料整合的目標是建立一致的設備、時間與批次關聯，並非只把資料分散存到更多儲存庫；完整性與單位一致性檢查應在建模前完成。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">點檢計畫應寫明部位、標準、方法、週期、責任與異常處置，依項目使用儀器及安全方法，不能概括成只靠五感。維護效果要連同停機損失、品質及安全評估；「預防性維護一定較便宜」或固定成本倍數都不能跨情境直接套用。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">對應考題核心</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">從考查核心回想本章觀念；點選題號可閱讀本題說明。</p>\n<div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">對應考題</th><th scope=\"col\">考查核心</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-9\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-9\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-9\">L22 第 9 題</a></td><td>PdM 分析預測與固定 PM 計畫的觸發區別</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-10\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-10\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-10\">L22 第 10 題</a></td><td>感測器、網路、資料庫構成資料採集鏈</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-22\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-22\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-22\">L22 第 22 題</a></td><td>設備管理不佳連帶影響品質、交期、安全與成本</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-24\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-24\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-24\">L22 第 24 題</a></td><td>預防性維護支持連續生產與維修效率</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-25\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-25\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-25\">L22 第 25 題</a></td><td>清理、整合、轉換及概念一般化區別</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-26\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-26\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-26\">L22 第 26 題</a></td><td>資料探勘效益與電子商務業務模式區別</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-36\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-36\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-36\">L22 第 36 題</a></td><td>網路監控、診斷、衰退預測與維護處置</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-43\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-43\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-43\">L22 第 43 題</a></td><td>點檢計畫的標準、工具、職責及五感界線</td></tr><tr id=\"exam-core-L22-50\" tabindex=\"-1\"><td><a class=\"study-link\" data-action=\"question-open\" data-question=\"L22-50\" data-material=\"M22102\" href=\"#/guide/questions/L22-50\">L22 第 50 題</a></td><td>反應性維護故障後恢復功能與成本比較邊界</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"study-h2\">深度研讀：可靠度、維護成本與預測資料標記</h2>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">先釐清失效模式與時間口徑</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">選擇維護策略應從失效後果、可偵測前兆、衰退速度、修復能力及備品取得時間出發。隨機電子故障、隨使用量磨耗與操作誤用不一定適用同一固定保養週期。低價零件若會造成重大連帶損失，也不能只按零件價格判定事後維護划算。另一方面，頻繁拆裝也可能引入安裝錯誤，因此預防維護須有明確失效機理與驗證，而非一味縮短週期。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">時間紀錄至少區分故障發生、報修、到場、等料、主動修理、測試及恢復。假設等待人員與備品共 2 小時、修理 1.5 小時、測試 0.5 小時，總停機為 4 小時；若企業將 MTTR 定義為修理加測試，該次 MTTR 用 2 小時，而不是自動代入 4。用 MTBF／(MTBF＋MTTR) 表示的可用度須配合這個定義；要評估營運損失時，則不能遺漏等待造成的停機。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">原創案例：平均壽命不能當成保證期限</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">假設同型設備在相同工況累計運轉 4,800 小時、故障 12 次、主動修復共 24 小時，則 MTBF 估計為 400 小時，MTTR 為 2 小時，相應簡化可用度約 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$400÷402=99.50\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo>÷</mo><mn>402</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>99.50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400÷402=99.50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">402</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.50%</span></span></span></span></span>。若暫以固定故障率模型描述，未來 t 小時無故障機率為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$R(t)=e^{-t/400}$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>400</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t)=e^{-t/400}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/400</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，模型與假設可參考 <a href=\"https://itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/apr/section1/apr161.htm\" class=\"study-link\">NIST 指數可靠度模型</a>。這不是說設備運轉到第 400 小時才會故障；固定故障率模型本身也不會表達磨耗加速。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">再假設團隊比較「立即停機檢修」與「繼續運轉 100 小時」，一次故障損失估計 90,000 元，立即檢修的停產及材料成本共 15,000 元。模型給出至少一次故障機率約 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$1-e^{-100/400}=22.12\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>400</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>22.12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-e^{-100/400}=22.12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">100/400</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22.12%</span></span></span></span></span>，若用「是否發生首個故障」的簡化損失模型，期望損失約 19,908 元。但不能僅由這個比較就宣稱檢修必然值得：固定故障率的記憶無關性意味著，若檢修只是換成相同狀態零件而未降低故障率，未來風險並不因此消失。還須證明檢修會移除什麼可處理的缺陷，以及處置後殘餘風險。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">若只比較未來 20 小時，首個故障風險成本約 4,389 元，與 100 小時結論不同。這些成本皆為原創假設，亦未包含連帶品質損失與強制必要維護；不能把純成本比較用來略過必要控制。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">建立不洩漏未來資訊的預測資料</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">預測資料的一列應描述「當時已知的特徵」及「之後指定視窗的結果」。例如預測未來 24 小時故障，只能使用預測時點之前的振動與負載；維修後填寫的故障原因、未來換件紀錄不能作為當時輸入。訓練與驗證可依時間先後切分，並檢查同設備相鄰視窗重疊造成的洩漏。觀察期結束而未滿 24 小時、感測器離線或停機未受觀察的資料，不能全部標成正常；應保留未知／截尾原因與可用標記。模型輸出還應包含可處置的提前量，僅在故障前一秒猜中，對備料排程可能沒有價值。</p>\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">進階練習與解析</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">練習 1：故障較少的一群可用度一定較高？</strong> A 群運轉 1,000 小時、故障 5 次、修復 20 小時；B 群運轉 1,000 小時、故障 10 次、修復 10 小時，時間定義一致。<strong class=\"study-strong\">解析：</strong>A 的 MTBF＝200、MTTR＝4，可用度約 98.04%；B 為 100、1，可用度約 99.01%。B 故障較頻繁但恢復快，可用度較高；仍不能據此選 B，因為每次故障的品質、安全與重啟損失可能不同，須回到失效後果比較。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">練習 2：預警準確度如何解讀？</strong> 測試期共有 8 次符合定義的故障，模型發出 20 個已去重且與故障一對一匹配的預警，其中 6 個命中。<strong class=\"study-strong\">解析：</strong>精確率為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$6÷20=30\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>÷</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6÷20=30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>，召回率為 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$6÷8=75\\%$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>÷</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6÷8=75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span>；有 14 次誤警與 2 次漏警。不能用「75%」概括成整體準確率，也不能只降低門檻追求召回而忽略維修團隊負荷。還應比較命中預警的提前量、不同設備的表現及誤警成本，再決定是否適合上線。</p>","questions":{"L22-9":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\"> L22 第 9 題（公告 A）把歷史故障、保養資料及迴歸分析歸為預測保養。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">B 是故障後修、C 是事先固定計畫、D 是免保養。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">實務分類還須問分析結果是否隨設備狀態預測失效時點：若只用歷史平均壽命設定固定年保養，仍可能是經統計設計的 PM，不能一概稱為 PdM。</p></section>","note":"公告A；若只按歷史平均訂固定週期，實務仍可能屬PM，PdM須檢查狀態與失效預測。","noteIds":["add1f2f55c35749f","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-10":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\"> 第 10 題（D）的治具不是題目所列資料採集鏈基本元件，感測器、網路與資料庫分別取得、傳輸、保存資料。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">裝有感測器的智慧治具仍可提供資料。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["188f8dbd2bf72589","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-22":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\"> 第 22 題（B）不能假設管理不佳而成本不變。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">劣化可能連帶造成品質、交期與安全問題。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["be7f7c0e7a2e934e","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-24":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">第 24 題（A）以預防活動支持生產連續性，並非降低維修效率。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["be7f7c0e7a2e934e","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-25":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">第 25 題（A）的整合重點是跨來源建立一致語意與關聯，並非把來源再分散到多個儲存庫。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">清理確認品質、轉換支援分析，一般化如「機台→產線→工廠」提升概念層級。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["188f8dbd2bf72589","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-26":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">第 26 題（C）的電子商務全球化屬業務模式，不能直接當作探勘分析步驟。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["188f8dbd2bf72589","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-36":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">第 36 題（B）否定「不能透過網路監控」。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">智慧維護是從狀態、診斷走向衰退預測與處置，不等於保證不故障。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">可對照 <a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/el/applied-economics-office/manufacturing/topics-manufacturing/manufacturing-machinery-maintenance\" class=\"study-link\">NIST 維護分類</a>。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["add1f2f55c35749f","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-43":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">第 43 題（C）判點檢方法時，須核對部位、判定標準、工具、週期及責任。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">眼耳等觀察可以補充，軸承振動、絕緣及精度仍須適當儀器。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">「味」尤其不應被理解為用口嘗試工業介質。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">操作員日常點檢、維修人員專業點檢及故障後復歸驗證，也不能以一張簽名表互相取代。</p></section>","note":"","noteIds":["0fd895b32422fc0f","1439b0a356221599"]},"L22-50":{"details":"<section class=\"question-reasoning\"><h3>判斷步驟</h3><p class=\"study-paragraph\">第 50 題（B）中，反應性維護的直接目標是故障後恢復功能，庫存管理不能代替此定義。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">需備品也不等於該策略會自動優化庫存。</p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">題目其他選項提到的「3 至 4 倍」只能保留為原題說法，跨設備比較應實算修復、停機、備品與監測成本。</p></section>","note":"原題成本3至4倍不能跨設備直接套用，應實算停機、修復、備品與監測成本。","noteIds":["be7f7c0e7a2e934e","1439b0a356221599"]}},"notes":{"add1f2f55c35749f":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">找觸發證據，不只找「數據」二字。</strong> L22 第 9 題（公告 A）把歷史故障、保養資料及迴歸分析歸為預測保養；B 是故障後修、C 是事先固定計畫、D 是免保養。實務分類還須問分析結果是否隨設備狀態預測失效時點：若只用歷史平均壽命設定固定年保養，仍可能是經統計設計的 PM，不能一概稱為 PdM。第 36 題（B）否定「不能透過網路監控」；智慧維護是從狀態、診斷走向衰退預測與處置，不等於保證不故障。可對照 <a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/el/applied-economics-office/manufacturing/topics-manufacturing/manufacturing-machinery-maintenance\" class=\"study-link\">NIST 維護分類</a>。</p>","materialCode":"M22102","heading":"試題判讀與選項辨析"},"be7f7c0e7a2e934e":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">維護效果看整體損失。</strong> 第 22 題（B）不能假設管理不佳而成本不變；劣化可能連帶造成品質、交期與安全問題。第 24 題（A）以預防活動支持生產連續性，並非降低維修效率。第 50 題（B）中，反應性維護的直接目標是故障後恢復功能，庫存管理不能代替此定義；需備品也不等於該策略會自動優化庫存。題目其他選項提到的「3 至 4 倍」只能保留為原題說法，跨設備比較應實算修復、停機、備品與監測成本。</p>","materialCode":"M22102","heading":"試題判讀與選項辨析"},"188f8dbd2bf72589":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">採集、整合與判斷各有工作。</strong> 第 10 題（D）的治具不是題目所列資料採集鏈基本元件，感測器、網路與資料庫分別取得、傳輸、保存資料；裝有感測器的智慧治具仍可提供資料。第 25 題（A）的整合重點是跨來源建立一致語意與關聯，並非把來源再分散到多個儲存庫；清理確認品質、轉換支援分析，一般化如「機台→產線→工廠」提升概念層級。第 26 題（C）的電子商務全球化屬業務模式，不能直接當作探勘分析步驟。</p>","materialCode":"M22102","heading":"試題判讀與選項辨析"},"0fd895b32422fc0f":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\">第 43 題（C）判點檢方法時，須核對部位、判定標準、工具、週期及責任。眼耳等觀察可以補充，軸承振動、絕緣及精度仍須適當儀器；「味」尤其不應被理解為用口嘗試工業介質。操作員日常點檢、維修人員專業點檢及故障後復歸驗證，也不能以一張簽名表互相取代。</p>","materialCode":"M22102","heading":"試題判讀與選項辨析"},"1439b0a356221599":{"html":"<p class=\"study-paragraph\"><strong class=\"study-strong\">對照 L22 第 9、10、22、24–26、36、43、50 題。</strong> 先找「何時啟動」：故障後修是反應性維護，固定日曆或運轉次數是預防性維護，依狀態門檻處置是 CBM，利用衰退趨勢或故障資料預估維護時點是 PdM。迴歸與統計分析也能支援預測，不必看到神經網路才算；反之，裝上感測器但沒有分析與處置流程，不能自稱完成預測維護。</p>","materialCode":"M22102","heading":"4. 公告試題導向：維護觸發條件與資料證據"}}}
